description	"Sith Heavy Trooper 

2-life units with purchase options including extra lives, elemental Grenades, a rapid-fire Carbine, and upgraded Saber Defense.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Vibrosaber
-- Saber Defense (0)
-- No Blaster Block
-- 15% faster Movement
> Vibrosword (Red)
-- 5% less Reach
> Vibrostaff (Staff)
-- 19% more Reach

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Stamina (0)
- Assemble (1) 

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]"
